{title: 666 - Cast Thy Burden Upon the Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #666 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 666}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Cast thy burden upon the Lord,
[Bb]And He shall sustain thee;
[Eb]He never will suffer the righteous to fall;
[Fm]He is at thy right hand.
[Eb]Thy mercy, [Ab]Lord, is great, and far [Bb]above the [Bb7/D]heavens;
[Bb7/D]Let none be made ashamed, that wait upon Thee.
{end_of_verse}
